    "text": "The number of bijective function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>99</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8943;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>99</mn></mfenced></math> is",
